      "blob_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/9abb2116193f05fe8430e41d949e5c42a9eb5df4/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx",
      "changes": 24,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx?ref=9abb2116193f05fe8430e41d949e5c42a9eb5df4",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -2107,6 +2107,18 @@ Combining `--enable-response-store` with `--disaggregation-mode=prefill` or `dec\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>The size of host KV cache memory pool in gigabytes, which will override the hicache_ratio if set.</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`0`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n+    </tr>\n+        <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-host-memory-mode`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Whether host memory is a persistent HiCache tier (`cache`) or a transient staging buffer between GPU and the storage backend (`buffer_only`). `buffer_only` requires `--hicache-storage-backend`.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`cache`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}><code>cache</code>, <code>buffer_only</code></td>\n+    </tr>\n+        <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-host-memory-fraction`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Fraction of the available host memory, bounded by visible cgroup memory.max/memory.high or v1 memory limits (after a 10 GiB reserve) that the HiCache host pools of all ranks on this machine may use. Applies only when neither `--hicache-ratio` nor `--hicache-size` is set: the default ratio is then reduced until the pools fit. Lower it when several engines share a memory cgroup.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`0.8`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: float</td>\n     </tr>\n         <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-write-policy`</td>\n@@ -2137,6 +2149,18 @@ Combining `--enable-response-store` with `--disaggregation-mode=prefill` or `dec\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Control when prefetching from the storage backend should stop.</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`timeout`</td>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}><code>best_effort</code>, <code>wait_complete</code>, <code>timeout</code></td>\n+    </tr>\n+        <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-storage-prefetch-retry-poll-interval`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Scheduling passes a queued request waits before its storage availability check is re-issued, when the prefetch found nothing and a backup may still be committing (under load the first check can run before it does). A re-issue that waits on staging or a moved match instead goes out on the next pass. Only passes that reach prefill scheduling count. 0 disables miss retries; known-hit deferrals are always re-issued.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`8`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n+    </tr>\n+        <tr>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-storage-prefetch-retry-max-attempts`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Storage availability re-issues a queued request may make, paced miss polls and immediate re-issues alike; past the cap it is admitted with whatever the device holds. 0 disables re-issues.</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`8`</td>\n+      <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"}}>Type: int</td>\n     </tr>\n         <tr>\n       <td style={{padding: \"9px 12px\", fontWeight: 500, backgroundColor: \"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\"}}>`--hicache-storage-backend-extra-config`</td>",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/9abb2116193f05fe8430e41d949e5c42a9eb5df4/docs%2Fdocs%2Fadvanced_features%2Fserver_arguments.mdx",
